OL,3,A'Wear more clothes if it's cold,'
OL,4,Aschools told as energy bills rise
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut principals have told BBC News NI it
OL,7,Fis not straightforward to cut heating
OL,8,Fcosts, with one describing her school's
OL,9,Fenergy bills as "ferocious".
